<qti-assessment-item xmlns="http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/imsqtiasi_v3p0" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/imsqtiasi_v3p0 https://purl.imsglobal.org/spec/qti/v3p0/schema/xsd/imsqti_asiv3p0_v1p0.xsd" identifier="pcb-item-1ce051f34f464de0a49977aab3675781" title="Practice It!: Foregone Q2" adaptive="true" time-dependent="false"><qti-response-declaration identifier="RESPONSE" cardinality="single" base-type="identifier"><qti-correct-response><qti-value>A</qti-value></qti-correct-response></qti-response-declaration><qti-outcome-declaration identifier="SCORE" cardinality="single" base-type="float"><qti-default-value><qti-value>0</qti-value></qti-default-value></qti-outcome-declaration><qti-outcome-declaration identifier="FEEDBACK" cardinality="single" base-type="identifier"/>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="INTERACTION_VISIBILITY" cardinality="single" base-type="identifier">
    <qti-default-value><qti-value>show_interaction</qti-value></qti-default-value>
  </qti-outcome-declaration><qti-item-body>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="show_interaction" outcome-identifier="INTERACTION_VISIBILITY" show-hide="show" class="qti-margin-0">
      <qti-content-body>
        <p>Choose the word that best completes the sentence.</p><p>With the visiting team down eleven players to injury, most reporters treated the final score as a ____ conclusion long before kickoff.</p><qti-choice-interaction response-identifier="RESPONSE" shuffle="true" max-choices="1"><qti-simple-choice identifier="A">foregone</qti-simple-choice><qti-simple-choice identifier="B">premature</qti-simple-choice><qti-simple-choice identifier="C">provisional</qti-simple-choice><qti-simple-choice identifier="D">unanimous</qti-simple-choice></qti-choice-interaction>
      </qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>

    <qti-feedback-block identifier="CORRECT" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show">
      <qti-content-body><p>Correct! A foregone conclusion is an outcome so certain that it seems settled before it even happens, which is exactly how the reporters treated this game. A premature conclusion is one reached too hastily, which criticizes the reasoning rather than describing genuine certainty; provisional means temporary and open to revision; and unanimous means agreed on by everyone, describing the reporters rather than the result.</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="INCORRECT" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show">
      <qti-content-body><p>Not quite! An outcome that appears decided in advance is a foregone conclusion. Premature is the sharpest near-miss: it means jumping to a conclusion too early, while this sentence presents the result as genuinely inevitable; provisional means subject to later change; and unanimous describes agreement among people, not the certainty of an outcome.</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
  </qti-item-body><qti-response-processing><qti-response-condition><qti-response-if><qti-match><qti-variable identifier="RESPONSE"/><qti-correct identifier="RESPONSE"/></qti-match><qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE"><qti-base-value base-type="float">1</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value><qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">CORRECT</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="completionStatus"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">completed</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="INTERACTION_VISIBILITY"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">hidden</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value></qti-response-if><qti-response-else><qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE"><qti-base-value base-type="float">0</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value><qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">INCORRECT</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="completionStatus"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">incomplete</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value></qti-response-else></qti-response-condition></qti-response-processing></qti-assessment-item>